text = "1. The aim is to get to the other side of the room
2. The player can be moved using A and D
3. Use trampolines for jumps
4. Trampolines cannot be reused
5. Drag trampolines onto the map
6. Avoid obstacles
7. Trampolines can only be placed once you reach a checkpoint"
